Package: dbVisuals
Type: Package
Title: Database-Powered Visualizations for Spatial Data
Version: 0.1.0.9004
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Timur", "Rizvanov",
      email = "timurr@bu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Author: Timur Rizvanov [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Timur Rizvanov <timurr@bu.edu>
Description: Provides a browser-based SQL Rooms interface for interactive exploration
    of GiottoDB spatial databases. SQL Rooms enables SQL queries
    and interactive visualizations using deck.gl and Mosaic. Also provides a
    spec-driven htmlwidget that bundles Mosaic and deck.gl in a single browser
    scope, sharing one DuckDB-WASM coordinator and one selection so Mosaic views
    cross-filter GPU-rendered scatterplots and GeoArrow polygon layers, with
    server-side data hydration over Arrow IPC and GeoArrow. Complements the
    'rDeckgl' and 'rMosaic' packages on CRAN.
